{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_01008","headline":"横吹曲辞 长安道 · 僧贯休","name":"横吹曲辞 长安道","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"憧憧合合，八表一辙。\n黄尘雾合，车马火热。\n名汤风雨，利辗霜雪。\n千车万駄，半宿关月。\n上有尧禹，下有夔契。\n紫气银轮兮常覆金阙，仙掌捧日兮浊河澄澈。\n愚将草木兮有言，与华封人兮不别。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"僧贯休","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_01008.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_01008","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}